Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:03.85,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The win of her tennis career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她职业生涯的代表性胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.26,0:00:06.65,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N属于郭涵煜！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:10.59,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}这一胜 郭涵煜是从绝境里抢回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:14.64,TL,,0,0,312,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}13{\fs68}日下午 武汉首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:16.24,TL,,0,0,312,,{\an2}外卡选手郭涵煜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:19.16,TL,,0,0,312,,{\an2}迎战{\fs78}12{\fs68}号种子科斯蒂亚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.92,TL,,0,0,312,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's too good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打得太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:52.12,TL,,0,0,312,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, it was a nice idea to change things up.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N变换打法的思路不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:54.90,TL,,0,0,312,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But just a tiny bit heavy-handed with the drop shot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可这记小球手感稍重
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:07.02,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's a good job from Sorana Cirstea in the opening set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科斯蒂亚首盘打得相当出色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:12.04,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just over half an hour it took to get the better of Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N仅半小时多便赢下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:16.53,TL,,0,0,456,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Who played well, really well. But the world number 16.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜打得不错 但对手世界{\fs78}16{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:19.81,TL,,0,0,456,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Motoring now with a 6-1 set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N已以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}拿下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:22.36,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}对手不断加深底线压力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.36,0:01:24.49,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}郭涵煜首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}失守
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:26.60,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}第二盘又陷入{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:29.94,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}连续丢掉{\fs78}9{\fs68}局 她还能怎么赢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.81,0:01:44.29,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nailed it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:47.66,TL,,0,0,366,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Great start from Guo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜开局打得真好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:51.87,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}郭涵煜没有认输
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.30,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}她一局一局咬住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:55.54,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}追到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:58.47,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}这场球 远远没有结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:07.56,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Superstar.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太出色了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.55,0:02:10.99,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Rock solid in the forecourt.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N网前处理稳如磐石
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.45,0:02:17.05,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 对手又来发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:19.09,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}郭涵煜再度追平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.09,0:02:21.35,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}但抢七{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.35,0:02:23.14,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}一个也输不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:28.60,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Return was a bit lucky. She was actually a bit late.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接发有点运气 她出手稍晚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:13.26,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nice change in height and shape from Guo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜改变回球高度和弧线
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.58,TL,,0,0,372,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it just unsettled Cirstea.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打乱了科斯蒂亚的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:57.56,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a remarkable transformation.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多么惊人的转变！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:02.55,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Three match points saved by Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜救回三个赛点！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:04.62,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And into a decider we go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛进入决胜盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.50,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Less aggressive.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N进攻变得保守
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.32,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Letting Guo come back into this match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让郭涵煜重新回到比赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:23.99,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}决胜盘 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}领先又变成{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.22,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}第二次绝境 郭涵煜又开始追！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:38.93,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wow, would you believe it?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N哇 你敢相信吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.15,0:04:47.64,TL,,0,0,360,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Unbelievable.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不可思议！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.75,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The win of her tennis career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她职业生涯的代表性胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:54.55,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N属于郭涵煜！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.01,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How has she done that?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她到底是怎么做到的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.51,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}From a set and four love down.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N落后一盘 次盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:02.77,TL,,0,0,372,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And then three match points down.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N然后又面对三个赛点！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.63,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has a first Top 20 win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她首次战胜世界前{\fs78}20{\fs68}！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:08.47,TL,,0,0,372,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A first WTA 1000 win.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首次赢下{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}正赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:12.27,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she does it on home soil.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而且 就在自己的主场！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:16.88,TL,,0,0,156,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a moment in the career of Guo Hanyu.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郭涵煜职业生涯难忘的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:22.02,TL,,0,0,456,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, what a comeback from her.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这真是一场了不起的逆转！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.15,0:05:26.21,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}制胜分{\fs78}30{\fs68}记 决胜盘{\fs78}17{\fs68}记
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.21,0:05:28.89,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}她越到绝境 越敢出手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:32.14,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点 又连追最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.44,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}这样的郭涵煜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:36.49,TL,,0,0,371,,{\an2}下一轮还能带来怎样的惊喜？
